#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#AEB : Autonomous Emergency Braking
#CCRs : Car-to-Car Rear Stationary
#EVT : Euro Vehicle Target
#VUT : Vehicle Under Test
#
#A CarSim Sensors license is required to run this simulation.  You may still view the animation and plots.
#
#The procedure in this simulation is based on a test scenario published by Euro NCAP for AEB systems. Here, a target is stationery and a variety of speeds are simulated for the vehicle with AEB.
#
#The EVT speed is defined with an output parameter Vx_EVT that can be set as a constant or managed with an equation.
#
#The HUD alert and speed controller are very simple for this example. They are provided to demonstrate the scenario, and are not based on any known control systems.
#END_EMBEDDED_NOTES

